/*
 * Southern defense tower basement
 * southern corner — south of stower1.
 *
 * Strategy A FluffOS room. Original
 * (SearchCmd, west stower4, north
 * stower1, up stower5) is
 * stower3_ldmud.lpc. Look-ats only:
 * search / climb / chain machinery /
 * raise/lower are not loaded. Frozen:
 * no Check* nightday (this room has
